m=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/q9AibXn7dUicibtqTcvjS6LFRsiaWU2VMpAibb6LSVJvJyqS50w7A7dVNV4iaAiaYT64JFibJexRe2YdfaEGuyCrcZLpTavg6fSNTibKyMhIct5qV5YU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>北京协和医学院</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>卫生健康管理政策学院</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2026年全国优秀大学生</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong><strong><span>活动通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/q9AibXn7dUicibaEibic903JUYGHS8o6I1tlribnaCPJzUYyNfk9y3ECZLDicfm0OmhBWNSrxJAxKpJdjsAGpsMv4skXuEraD1xPAdZT84ACPp3qV4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>北京协和医学院简介</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>中国医学科学院成立于1956年，北京协和医学院成立于1917年，中国医学科学院北京协和医学院自1957年起实行院校合一的管理体制，是我国最高医学研究机构和领衔医学教育机构。院校始终牢记初心使命，以引领我国医学科技教育发展和维护人民健康为己任，教育人才辈出，科研硕果累累，医疗领衔行业，为我国现代科学医学体系的建立和发展做出了重要贡献。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/q9AibXn7dUicicJTRFssfArbdl24ev26TbPJlP33AUQeU1jicMxkyRu3TNCjNzCbgdPxrEdxLzuf8EU6sYwZGctAcia3erwQENjb2deoJbkYPHZQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>卫生健康管理政策学院简介</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>北京协和医学院卫生健康管理政策学院（简称“生策学院”）成立于2020年7月，旨在建设中国卫生健康卓越管理人才的核心基地，培养高层次卫生健康管理领军人才；建立国家卫生健康管理政策智库，发展卫生健康管理政策学科，开展管理政策科学研究和实践探索，推动卫生健康治理体系和治理能力现代化，助力健康中国建设。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请时间</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>即日-2026年6月21日</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动时间</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月上旬</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动形式</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线下举办，具体日程以后续通知为准</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好，诚实守信，身心健康；</span></p></li><li><p><span>2027年毕业的在校优秀大学本科生；</span></p></li><li><p><span>不限专业，鼓励有医学、药学、护理学、管理学、统计学、经济学、数学、计算机学、环境学等相关专业背景，对科研工作具有浓厚兴趣的同学报名；鼓励跨学科交叉学科的同学报名；</span></p></li><li><p><span>综合素质突出，学习成绩优秀，本科阶段总成绩排名在所读学校同年级本专业前20%之内，能获得所在高校推荐免试生资格者优先；</span></p></li><li><p><span>具有良好听、说、读、写的英语应用能力，达到国家英语六级426分以上或相当水平。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料与流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>扫描二维码填写报名信息：</span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/q9AibXn7dUic9PxqVNgXicibPx3ka7CoViacOPHNTDhucR9HE1ROcQaLODaYx9Mgl3icDTWcbN4TmrS78BwVnGf60mrwFoLugtlKOWnYkgC9RhAkI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><ol><li><p><span>下载并填写报名表进行报名（附件1）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>个人陈述（包括但不限于兴趣特点、经历以及你选择协和生策学院的理由以及攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划等，1000字以内），需在最后手写签名（模板可下载附件2）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>本科阶段成绩单、截至报名时间的加权成绩及排名（加盖教务部门公章）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>英语六级水平证书或相关英语成绩证明；</span></p></li><li><p><span>其他证明材料（如发表论文、专利，各类获奖证书等）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>专家推荐信2封，需副教授及以上职称专家亲笔签字；</span></p></li><li><p><span>身份证及学生证复印件;</span></p></li><li><p><span>承诺书（附件3）。</span></p></li></ol></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>请提交以上所有材料电子版，申请人需按照1-8顺序扫描生成一份PDF格式文件，文件名为</span><strong><span>“</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>XX大学—XX专业—XX（姓名）—2026年夏令营申请材料</span><span><span>”</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>于</span></span><span><strong><span>2026年6月21日24:00</span></strong><span><span>前发送至邮箱</span></span><strong><span>shengce_pumc@163.com</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>请报名营员务必在规定时间内认真准确填写并提交申请材料的所有内容，如因信息提供有误，由此导致的相关损失和责任由营员自行负责，本次活动的所有申请材料将作保密处理。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>材料审核与入选通知</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>招生人数</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>拟招募线下营员名额60人。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>材料审核与资格审定</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>因报名人数较多，不提供电话确认。所提交的申请材料只适用于当次申请。</span></p><p><span><span>夏令营材料审核和入营资格审定工作由生策学院专门工作委员会负责。夏令营入营名单将在学院官方网站上公布，不再另行通知，请大家关注。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>费用待遇</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营活动不收取任何费用，为营员购买意外险</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>工作组不为营员统一安排住宿和交通，仅为京外生源提供参营补贴</span><span>。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>了解更多学院信息及导师信息，可通过以下链接进入学院官网及协和医学院“导师风采”主页查看。</span></p><p><span>学院官网：</span></p><p><span>https://shpm.pumc.edu.cn/index.htm</span></p><p><span>协和医学院“导师风采”主页：</span></p><p><span>https://yzbss.pumc.edu.cn/basicinfo/tutorinfo/tutorcollege/026</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></se